We begin with the linear profile decomposition.

The proof follows a familiar outline (cf. [@Bahouri-Gerard:1999:profile-wave; @Carles-Keraani:2007:profile-schrod-1d; @Jiang-Pausader-Shao:2010:4th-NLS]). We construct the linear profile decomposition inductively. At each stage we will pass to a further subsequence, but to avoid a proliferation of sub- and superscripts, we

